+## Code adapted from b12x
+
+GLM-5.3-Flash's RoCE all-gather (`families/glm5_next/cuda/roce.cpp`, `roce.cu`, `roce_common.h`, `roce.py`;
+glm53-tensorfold-spark patch 0230) adapts "RoCEnante" from [b12x](https://github.com/local-inference-lab/b12x)
+(`b12x/comm/roce/`: `_roce_proxy.c`, `_allgather_cute.py`, `_cute_intrinsics.py`, `roce_oneshot.py`), Copyright
+2026 Luke Alonso and the b12x contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the license text is in
+[`LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`](LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). b12x has no NOTICE file. Changes: the RDMA proxy is C++ in a
+torch extension with one RoCE v2 GID index per HCA and an optional CPU; the all-gather kernel is CUDA C++ instead of
+CuTe DSL, dim-0 only, for any alignment and byte count, with a wall-clock timeout and b12x PR #438's completion word
+and wrap-safe failure flag; setup, GID detection, HCA pairing by subnet, the NCCL probe and fallback, and the
+engine integration are new.
+
